   <taskbody>
      <context>
         <p>You must have <xref href="../marking_clauses_45220111/marking_clauses.dita">marked static text in the agreement document as a clause</xref> in the same session using Playbook. Unmarking a clause removes Apttus clause properties and returns the text to a static state.</p>
      </context>
      <steps>
         <step>
            <cmd>Go to <b>Document &gt; Clauses</b>.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd> Click on the clause name in the list. The document scrolls to highlight the selected clause.</cmd>
            <info>
               <fig>
                  <title>49086821</title>
                  <image href="../attachments/45220112/49086821.png" width="2560" height="828" placement="break">
                     <alt>placeholder</alt>
                  </image>
               </fig>
            </info>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click the  <b>unMark </b>icon. The Panel refreshes and the clause no longer appears in the list. The clause boundary is removed from the marked text and it returns to its previous state.</cmd>
            <info>
               <image href="../attachments/45220112/49086822.png" width="36" height="34" placement="inline">
                     <alt>placeholder</alt>
                  </image>
               
            </info>
         </step>
      </steps>
